d_at":"2026-10-14T20:40:56Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/base/base/releases/download/v1.5.0/basectl-v1.5.0-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.sha256"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/base/base/tarball/v1.5.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/base/base/zipball/v1.5.0","body":"## What Changed\r\n\r\n> [!IMPORTANT]\r\n> **Base Mainnet**: This release is safe for mainnet node operators to upgrade to. Denim is only scheduled on Base Sepolia, so mainnet behavior is unchanged. The mainnet Denim activation will come in a future release.\r\n> **Base Sepolia**: Operators must upgrade to this release by October 21 at 18:00:00 UTC for the Denim hardfork. See [here](https://docs.base.org/upgrades/denim/overview) for more information.\r\n>\r\n> `--enable-experimental-validity-transactions` has been removed as a CLI flag for `base-reth-node`. Validity transactions are enabled by default now that Cobalt is live on every network. Operators must remove the flag from their entrypoint command if it is present, or the node will fail to start.\r\n>\r\n> The default proofs history window (`--proofs-history.window`) has changed from 1,296,000 blocks (about 1 month at 2s blocks) to 6,480,000 blocks (about 15 days at 200ms blocks). Operators who rely on the default and need a different retention period should set the flag explicitly.\r\n\r\n### base-reth-node\r\n- Denim support (Base Sepolia only)\r\n- Validity transactions are always on, and the experimental flag is removed\r\n- jemalloc is now the default global allocator, and `asm-keccak` and `keccak-cache-global` are enabled by default\r\n- Faster proof generation: parallel witness multiproof prewarming, exact point lookups for proofs state reads, and reuse of RocksDB iterators\r\n- Faster proofs snapshot downloads: parallel resumable range streams, extraction during download, and manifest checksum verification\r\n- Bug fixes and improvements\r\n\r\n### base-consensus\r\n- Denim support (Base Sepolia only), including a maximum sequencer drift of 6 hours from Denim onward\r\n- RPC methods that the consensus node does not serve are now forwarded to the execution client\r\n- Bug fixes and improvements\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/base/base/compare/v1.4.2...v1.5.0"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/base/base/releases/395115199","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/base/base/releases/395115199/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/base/base/releases/395115199/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/base/base/releases/tag/v1.4.2","id":395115199,"author":{"login":"haardikk21","id":16539849,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTM5ODQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16539849?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/haardikk21","html_url":"https://github.com/haardikk21","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haardikk21/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haardikk21/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haardikk21/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haardikk21/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haardikk21/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haardikk21/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haardikk21/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haardikk21/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haardikk21/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDONzq8V84XjPq_","tag_name":"v1.4.2","target_commitish":"main","name":"v1.4.2","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-09-23T22:33:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T00:09:05Z","published_at":"2026-09-23T22:49:04Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/base/base/releases/assets/584711089","id":584711089,"node_id":"RA_kwDONzq8V84i2fux","name":"base-consensus-v1.4.2-aarch64-apple